                <head>No. 791<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>In telegram 374 from Tokyo, August 16, Allison voiced his concern to the Secretary over certain aspects
                    of United States policy in East Asia. The Secretary replied in telegram 395 to
                    Tokyo, August 20. For text of both telegrams, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v14p1/d253">Documents 253</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v14p1/d260">260</ref>.</p>
            </div>
